sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Usuario
    participant C as Controller REST
    participant UC as Application Service<br/>(Use Case)
    participant AD as JPA Adapter
    participant DB as MySQL Database
    participant PS as PersonaService
    participant DS as DomicilioService
    participant IPS as InscripcionPagoService

    U->>C: GET /inscripcion/full/{facultadId}/{personaId}/{documentoId}/{lectivoId}
    C->>UC: findInscripcionFull()
    UC->>UC: findByUnique()
    UC-->>C: inscripcion
    UC->>IPS: findByUnique()
    IPS-->>UC: inscripcionPago
    UC->>PS: findByPersonaIdAndDocumentoId()
    PS-->>UC: personaPago
    UC->>DS: findByPersonaIdAndDocumentoId()
    DS-->>UC: domicilioPago
    UC-->>C: InscripcionFullDto
    C-->>U: 200 OK (InscripcionFullDto)

    U->>C: POST /inscripcion
    C->>UC: execute(domainModel)
    UC->>AD: save(entity)
    AD->>DB: INSERT
    DB-->>AD: OK
    AD-->>UC: entitySaved
    UC->>UC: generarDocumentos()
    UC->>UC: enviarEmail()
    UC-->>C: domainModelResult
    C-->>U: 201 Created (ResponseDTO)